ogies <em>Frontend</em><small>au coeur de nos réalisations</small></span></h2><ul class="nav flex gap-[10px] m-0 justify-start"><li><button class="btn c--4 bgc--1-2 btn-shadow-sm px-0 size-[48px] flex items-center justify-center" data-uk-slider-item="previous"><i class="es-icon-chevron-left"></i></button></li><li><button class="btn c--4 bgc--1-2 btn-shadow-sm px-0 size-[48px] flex items-center justify-center" data-uk-slider-item="next"><i class="es-icon-chevron-right"></i></button></li></ul></div><div class="tech-slider-card__body md:px-[10px] uk-child-width-1-1"><ul class="tech-list gap-[10px] gap-y-[20px] md:gap-y-[40px] lg:gap-y-[50px]"><!-- wp:create-block/tech-item -->\n<li class="wp-block-create-block-tech-item tech-item"><figure><div class="img-container"><img src="" alt="Technology"/></div><figcaption><span>Technology</span></figcaption></figure></li>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/tech-item --></ul></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:create-block/tech-card -->\n\n<!-- wp:create-block/tech-card -->\n<div class="wp-block-create-block-tech-card"><div class="tech-slider-card__content"><div class="tech-slider-card__header flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between px-[40px] md:items-center"><h2 class="title title--h2 rte rte--em-c-5 c--2"><span>Les technologies <em>Frontend</em><small>au coeur de nos réalisations</small></span></h2><ul class="nav flex gap-[10px] m-0 justify-start"><li><button class="btn c--4 bgc--1-2 btn-shadow-sm px-0 size-[48px] flex items-center justify-center" data-uk-slider-item="previous"><i class="es-icon-chevron-left"></i></button></li><li><button class="btn c--4 bgc--1-2 btn-shadow-sm px-0 size-[48px] flex items-center justify-center" data-uk-slider-item="next"><i class="es-icon-chevron-right"></i></button></li></ul></div><div class="tech-slider-card__body md:px-[10px] uk-child-width-1-1"><ul class="tech-list gap-[10px] gap-y-[20px] md:gap-y-[40px] lg:gap-y-[50px]"><!-- wp:create-block/tech-item -->\n<li class="wp-block-create-block-tech-item tech-item